  "body": "This eliminates paint timing monkey patching, and fixes some minor issues with when we mark paint timing. \n\nThis is necessary for us to correctly report event duration for the event timing spec. Issue [here](https://github.com/WICG/event-timing/issues/6). \n\n@domenic - you took a look at this [here](https://github.com/tdresser/html/pull/1).\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/78741b7...545cdbd/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">/infrastructure.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/78741b7...545cdbd/infrastructure.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3923/78741b7...545cdbd/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 16, 2018, 6:58 PM GMT (545cdbd)\">diff</a> )",
